  - {fileID: 160749357234345346, guid: bd5c7c4970615b84b96198772f50bcdc, type: 3}
  dialogue:
  - Welcome to the tutorial!
  - Blacksite trailblazer is an RPG-battler where positioning matters.
  - Before any combat happens, press [E] to choose where your heroes start.
  - Put your heroes in the lower bar so they can heal rather than fight. Sometimes
    its good to take a breather!
  - If one of your heroes fall during combat, don't worry, they'll come back at 1hp!
  - Assuming, well, they weren't the last party member to fall.
  - If that happens, you lose!
